{"conversations": [{"role": "system", "content": "", "tools": "[{\"function\": {\"name\": \"calculate_math\", \"description\": \"计算数学表达式的结果，支持加减乘除、幂运算、开方等\", \"parameters\": {\"type\": \"object\", \"properties\": {\"expression\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"description\": \"数学表达式，如 123+456、2**10、sqrt(144)\"}}, \"required\": [\"expression\"]}}}]"}, {"role": "user", "content": "如果我有200元，买了一个价格是80元的物品，剩下的钱能买多少个15元的文具？"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "首先，计算购买价格为80元的物品后剩余的钱：  \n200元 - 80元 = 120元。\n\n然后，用剩余的120元除以每个文具15元的价格，计算能买多少个文具：  \n120 ÷ 15 = 8个。\n\n因此，剩下的钱可以买8个15元的文具。  \n答案是：8个。"}]}
{"conversations": [{"role": "system", "content": "", "tools": "[{\"function\": {\"name\": \"calculate_math\", \"description\": \"计算数学表达式的结果，支持加减乘除、幂运算、开方等\", \"parameters\": {\"type\": \"object\", \"properties\": {\"expression\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"description\": \"数学表达式，如 123+456、2**10、sqrt(144)\"}}, \"required\": [\"expression\"]}}}]"}, {"role": "user", "content": "What is the result of 25 multiplied by 4 plus 15 divided by 3?"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "", "tool_calls": "[{\"function\": {\"name\": \"calculate_math\", \"arguments\": \"{\\\"expression\\\": \\\"25 * 4 + 15 / 3\\\"}\"}}]"}, {"role": "tool", "content": "{\"result\": 105.0}"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "The result of 25 multiplied by 4 plus 15 divided by 3 is 105."}]}
